      "type": "text",
      "x": 571,
      "y": 836.5,
      "width": 842.9833374023438,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 589315696,
      "version": 535,
      "versionNonce": 1115873424,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788254133527,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Celery (Background task) uses emit to send a message to the client via the consumer.\nCelery also stores the last thing it did in Redis.\nNext time the client asks for something from the consumer, the consumer \nreads Redis and decides what to do based on Celery's task's last action. \nAlso, Celery uses Redis to remember what happened up until now (history)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Celery (Background task) uses emit to send a message to the client via the consumer.\nCelery also stores the last thing it did in Redis.\nNext time the client asks for something from the consumer, the consumer \nreads Redis and decides what to do based on Celery's task's last action. \nAlso, Celery uses Redis to remember what happened up until now (history)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
